  "title": "PSPNLFIELD.FIELDNUM stays a contiguous 1..N order: App Designer renumbers existing controls when controls are added or deleted",
  "statement": "FIELDNUM is not an append counter: added controls are placed inside the order and the controls after them move down; deleting a control closes the gap. A writer must keep FIELDNUM contiguous and expect App Designer to renumber on its next save.",
